  partName: Valve Cover
  description: The Valve Cover, situated at the middle-center-center of the Hover
    Engine, is a large and complex-shaped component that encloses the engine's valves
    and valve train. Its standard surface material and design provide a sealed environment
    for the valves to operate, minimizing oil leaks and maintaining engine performance.
    Interestingly, the Valve Cover's design must accommodate the engine's valve train
    geometry and motion, while also providing access for maintenance and repair.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
